@prefix cco:  <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# Julian Date: (https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000359) consists of the Julian Day Number
# and the fractional part of the day. 
# julian date represents a 'day'   
# A temporal instant used in astronomy and other scientific applications to represent a 
# specific point in time.


##TemporalPosition subclass of TemporalInstant
#Julian Date is a subclass of TemporalPosition, which is a subclass of TemporalInstant.
cco:ont00000359 rdfs:subClassOf time:TemporalPosition .

#rerun of step 8: CCO to QUDT class mappings (Project 3, step 8 re-run).

# Multi-Day Temporal Interval: a one-dimensional temporal region spanning days -> an interval with distinct start and end
cco:ont00000211 rdfs:subClassOf time:ProperInterval .

# Time of Day: "a Temporal Instant that is part of a Day" -> a zero-extent temporal entity
cco:ont00000223 rdfs:subClassOf time:Instant .